#: scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b46aa7593cde900b5dfd8d0c867f53bbdb5055da675d35dd24ef079bc0264e1
#. default-sha256: 46c56c246f6dbcac7759b1c8884c6a4db6433e46b6de4542ec7736d44ae7c950
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The Pacific Railroad’s “Last Spike” ceremony was drawing nearer by "
"the day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La cérémonie du « dernier clou » de la ligne du Pacifique "
"approchait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56c155ad82b7c99c3c634c5e8fa692b05dfba5ba96c60d94005d2777a28ce8b7
#. default-sha256: a35e570faff53b2358d00921709604101c44c736153a64f4ffcefb30090c8e77
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day was, coincidentally, the deadline the two of them had set for themselves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Jacopo to confront his wife, and the White-Haired Girl to wait for him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce jour était, comme par hasard, la limite que le couple s’était fixé—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ Jacopo pour "
"voir sa femme en face, et la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs pour arrêter de l’attendre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c708d9d913dd5dfaa0bb3996796b420d16503d29370614e3edbbbc2e75536ea
#. default-sha256: d68339a342dee3248c5d74b70ad28570a8ef9d40d0417644a273dd0feb7be58e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as that day approached, she continued to write letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et au fur et à mesure que ce jour approchait, elle continuait d’écrire des lettres."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 873d158bbea3ef2ea02726c0bd63b691a6a52804fee9feee545eb5101eee1fc0
#. default-sha256: f6b0bbbe5c3544d0bf462bee885fc3f7c6b3f6d5219ae7a743627878b17c4f99
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wrote the letters purely by force of habit,⟪k:1⟫despite having been worn visibly thin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle les écrivait purement par habitude,⟪k:1⟫alors même qu’elle avait considérablement "
"maigri."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52f1bab04feace421ce3fc3240dff20f6310c70a8e2a911acdfd1c414fb7aa36
#. default-sha256: c9834419d027e619da6b6fe2e5652330d7e3ef7084dd7370f681d328df7f0962
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I expect that she could not stop—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that the act of writing was all that kept her "
"from going mad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je pense qu’elle ne pouvait s’arrêter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ que le fait d’attendre était la seule chose "
"qui l’empêchait de devenir folle."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8512de9e4f7fee26bf2afa2d2fc57d57bdfc2723864a15c6355797d159d6e557
#. default-sha256: 88374845e0aed348405c21e01fad672b87e9ae9d50188cb28125f6894a54156b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By focusing her attention on another person through her letters, she was able to maintain "
"her grip on herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En concentrant son attention sur une autre personne à travers ses lettres, elle arrivait "
"ainsi à se contrôler elle-même."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95e41914c861a50a54d8452cf5dac845081e67d1b55a14f26da771b8d1a1821c
#. default-sha256: d7f268ffda6d4dbcb4ef5d2caa4b4b72492ceb069ca236e732fcd904ed606b91
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that day would put an end to her suffering and despair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When the railroad was "
"completed, all their misunderstandings would be cleared up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ce jour-là mettrait fin à sa souffrance et à son désespoir.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quand la ligne "
"serait finie, tous les malentendus se dissiperaient."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fed607a9d7b8495b1418bc7995b04c4edf7266968cea375808b975a810291bd
#. default-sha256: 505bb163c5cb765267786259ed36183a1c407379ee8d217db20fb032cc788ba9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They would return to the smiling, happy couple they had been when they were first married."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils retourneraient au temps d’avant, quand ils s’étaient mariés, un couple heureux et "
"souriant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a77bcd519cffa2a2c3285300e1a675bef59612eb7637bbec3a22a8b8b12590f2
#. default-sha256: 4c048314441f189f78dbdec1284a31263bd0226a6efbec5e56ffbf57eb238974
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The harsh winter would finally come to a close, melting away into the past and allowing them "
"to step into the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le rude hiver toucherait enfin à sa fin, ferait fondre le passé et leur permettrait d’aller "
"de l’avant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 967d2239376240a348cac99b7a3cf6927a34953cea44b58ed5e39f14fd7efdfe
#. default-sha256: 87e9b2410a7725e08640e63fa3d69f40f6342f4715836d0c6e4c5fc45e82e72a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With constant prayer in my heart, I impatiently awaited the railroad’s opening ceremony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tout en priant de tout mon cœur, j’attendais impatiemment la cérémonie d’ouverture de la "
"ligne de chemin de fer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0dd3b53c5c4c25316b77d0af759ce00c06743b639a64f52df5be5c06598167c6
#. default-sha256: 273fc11f083337ce6328e0c92f30dff06cb72c2956e55f86d47f393a91425b7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I do not, after all, wish for anyone to fall into any kind of misfortune..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Après tout, je ne souhaite à personne de connaître le malheur..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb95660aeaeb7b3289db4f6abc6a4fc7fc11777928e8793bc5d117585bd97dbb
#. default-sha256: a1380c51d3b174529232d15b94a6dbc8d79cef824cb4af2705645bd8d88c1134
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that goes for you as well, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et cela vous concerne aussi, Maître."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db31a1a846a39843b86b3190e2a3557948bc3f349b5a2fe672fa75b635bbd565
#. default-sha256: 444e7d07c1a456898a8ba4a08901f2e7202007b2c34d3c29968d5a483701e7f9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, Master... ⟪k:1⟫The door is soon to be shut upon this era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ présent, Maître... ⟪k:3⟫La porte va bientôt se refermer sur cette époque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fa36c2eea51842e4e5e5d96db5d81f26b782cd5e3511bd3dfbf957de0713c5c
#. default-sha256: 677e0a054060d58cb67dbaaa6bccdc548dc38ba77bef1ebee30f343005fa54dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you prepared to see what happens next?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I see. Very well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ê⟪k:2⟫tes-vous prêt à voir la suite ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je vois. Très bien."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df9fc455adeff839019d38da7ac6352e4a65de783fe96e83aa7d16b496072d46
#. default-sha256: 44d1e1078d96ffd56199c9c341a129513e5dae3ac3449faafe0aec2da97b97fa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then allow us to make our way to that final day.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫See with your own eyes, Master, "
"how this tale concludes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alors, permettez-moi de vous guider jusqu’à ce dernier jour.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Voyez vous-même, de "
"vos propres yeux, Maître, comment se finit ce conte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98d7a8fbac4dd16daed06a3dd0e59c21194b4eebfd1bb4f9ff0bad7ec038c052
#. default-sha256: fcd8b4ac07b64cfb39a5aac29fee7617e370e1953fa48b6fa0cfe07b814b257c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And please... ⟪k:1⟫do not let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et je vous en prie... ⟪k:1⟫ne lâchez pas ma main."

#: scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0297a4d1107a097abdd060cb916544a518bc90b11478857581ffdbde51dd51bd
#. default-sha256: 4658fa56634218cd50ab80a2f9c9ea92209076e6579836508eab2ac5ddafabce
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f868edbbbc00d9448d28c5822d483ec42a477ced38f8683435f3fef4a1dc38d1
#. default-sha256: 690af7cc2e9c433e4a3853eb10c3838103334dd684ca4623226b7480d436fa2f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The night before the opening ceremony, the master of the house headed for his wife’s shed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La veille au soir de la cérémonie d’ouverture, le maître de la maison se dirigea vers la "
"remise de son épouse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b29465d649195bd0cf8f2d626ef88f0830ccf1755a4d193bce6ecb0cd8b407b
#. default-sha256: 80b89f48d9fdcda104ced5739ac24191420ee4883e84543ca32439911f50777f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a tension on his face, but a surety in his step.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He had found the resolve "
"to speak with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Son visage était tendu mais son pas assuré.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il s’était enfin décidé à lui parler."

#: scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02ab43dd14194de634a7bfd00e74e280ef29baf74305efa41e3f3313c146704
#. default-sha256: 0c521e263719c7707525fe2e2f286d9bd00919e3c28fcdcd6dbca103e026cf93
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having locked her away for so long in the shed like a common prisoner, Jacopo was hardly "
"optimistic about what she might say to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme il l’avait enfermée pendant si longtemps comme une vulgaire prisonnière, Jacopo "
"n’était pas très optimiste sur ce qu’elle lui dirait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6412f9aab567cfadfca6f89b7589d5570b5128b3f581925bc8ab8f01027832d2
#. default-sha256: f80924f89b828442e915cf30e9bd315ae3df00d02084f410d016b4f0668febf4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had undeniably mistreated her, said heartless and cruel things to her, and even gotten "
"physically violent with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il l’avait indéniablement maltraitée, lui avait dit des choses dures et cruelles et il était "
"même devenu violent avec elle."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31c5f9b6b9db2178b31fe87d7fbabaf79a26ebc7aa7ce387be474df4b6b25d05
#. default-sha256: 86080fb339443ebdd8f4acdb21b5ef6526b2fc1deb8a6375c3175b7358f8c475
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His actions were inexcusable, even if they were in response to her infidelity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ses actes étaient impardonnables, même en arguant que c’était en réponse à son infidélité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9f17dbc4f9adb668cee26448a52eb60309a76807da2a0c1281d5051c7659327
#. default-sha256: 2e245938662b27d7f21874f484e0edf8dcc1846373def885b4f45c92aff5b205
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course, the very infidelity which had driven him to such behavior had not, in fact, taken "
"place, but he was unaware of that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bien sûr, cette infidélité qui l’avait conduit à un tel comportement n’avait en fait jamais "
"eu lieu mais il ne le savait pas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe34df544f5b02720bbccd1fb89c46b0ef7a3c43a1a60d2efa0194d4a1da2067
#. default-sha256: d5652099c47f797498f05cf4fa46943c33975de8eb73752d34ae7308fd5e246c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a chance they would never reconcile their misunderstandings, and that this "
"predicament would not have a positive resolution, but he still clung to a tiny fragment of hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il y avait une chance pour qu’ils ne dissipent jamais leur malentendu et que cette situation "
"ne trouve pas d’issue heureuse, mais il s’accrochait quand même à une petite lueur d’espoir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1573ddc333abb130deb0d9612b65e9583a587e60375fee24a13e2b1413f7c4d
#. default-sha256: 13a6dce3822f1f49d722da784e02ad1fc2b8e46c54eb3ec03e469c7c0b776e0a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He wanted to start over with the White-Haired Girl, to make a new future with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il voulait recommencer à zéro avec la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs, construire un nouvel avenir "
"avec elle."

#: scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3408501dae27c6b4b118e46b929fcec684b77c63636d7742a04c5a73d197281d
#. default-sha256: bf559ae57e9ecd5a987f86e14fe6b2308600de58927af1116616671b7136dab4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With that desire burning strong in his heart, he stood before the door to her shed and "
"called out to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avec ce désir qui brûlait fort dans son cœur, il s’arrêta devant la porte de la remise et "
"l’appela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4B0BB762_4B96_4477_B69D_442908B2BD4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 798b414f965b8158b0a43692d1eec5caf2db0387b0617b2151a1dc318b3d0acc
#. default-sha256: c906a234aca0fdd0bf588c95ac3300fc5740a87937982e9e74402599da923013
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4B0BB762_4B96_4477_B69D_442908B2BD4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you awake?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It’s me, Jacopo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫May I come in?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ê⟪k:4⟫tes-vous debout ?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫C’est moi, Jacopo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Puis-je entrer ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5AAE587A_3589_4AB5_8902_3829339585B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adf7104c9247212374e88f6cba5c61c69515c573942a735a5ae5bb088f4b91a4
