#: scenario3:scenario3_A43BA456_BD46_45F6_8BFE_E661C62BA29C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2833742f1ddfa4964f6be7d7625426302f8de23f6ebb871ea837c69940088c4c
