msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A43BA456_BD46_45F6_8BFE_E661C62BA29C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Considering how you must feel about me, I shouldn’t be surprised."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne devrais pas être surpris, sachant ce que vous devez ressentir à mon égard."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BD2FF15_7620_44A1_A6DC_55C3AA8107EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 035716993ff9c01f55f4c57109a184f765dac22c40cd704bdfa1dc217f056610
#. default-sha256: 6485dff51925d853e5abc06ebf9f3d98d440f27be81d922fe6513c0d9b4c1033
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BD2FF15_7620_44A1_A6DC_55C3AA8107EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fine, then you don’t have to let me in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But please at least hear me out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Très bien, vous n’êtes pas obligée de me faire entrer.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mais je vous en prie, "
"au moins écoutez-moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55467d6cc81b51736c0146e7c665e806710f59df9c973d7cfa14bdf5df058f5c
#. default-sha256: 8f873e29d81956e51815e6fdf2e2eb51d1579b7dd5e3c7d25815109fb3194281
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Do you remember the day, shortly after we first met, when we went on our honeymoon—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫if you can even call the little walk we took a “honeymoon”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Est-ce que vous vous souvenez du jour, peu après notre rencontre, où nous sommes partis "
"en lune de miel—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ si on peut appeler cette petite promenade une « lune de miel » ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EB8BE68_C493_4B2F_9754_C84D02B1D6D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3b94725950d57acc156cc4393e33a0453f18c597bcbfa46e832358caa3b0447
#. default-sha256: 6844af8bd09e5866028f6b3349b65273abecf68c24c096770c914157d68f317b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EB8BE68_C493_4B2F_9754_C84D02B1D6D3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was unable to do anything nice for you then either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Déjà, à l’époque, j’étais incapable de faire un geste gentil pour vous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_112CA0BD_E718_42D6_A0E1_B8C8842A7736
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75f60133ed272797acf17426e3cf1e5fc0e7c15642fa7a13d6f5103a74ced617
#. default-sha256: 004ee68579c5766f811f55862935b32b7c4a4e236ab202cbc3e06a2fd5ba24c3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_112CA0BD_E718_42D6_A0E1_B8C8842A7736"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no experience, no idea how to interact with an upper-class woman like you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je n’avais aucune expérience, aucune idée de la manière d’agir avec une femme de la haute "
"société."

#: scenario3:scenario3_669C4C2D_6158_40F2_B49A_7C6F9D658288
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4598f2dadac2da43879c4ce1d6569f79fa06f5808bc6b15f26088ba816b4ffb
#. default-sha256: ec23b100a06c3c2852ca8ec912d16947d4b296711857c1eb2c88db83465e8f40
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_669C4C2D_6158_40F2_B49A_7C6F9D658288"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know what I should do for you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And yes, I know, that makes me sound "
"juvenile."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne savais pas comment me comporter.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eh oui, je sais, cela paraît puéril."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10513E68_864E_4D8F_8860_24EA263673B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dd3ba349c296e1427f1364df6832b33750649b6e7b6bdcb691e4c7cc4d18e1a
#. default-sha256: 3e840470dbf4c775e6c7eba58d463e2e09ca67c74773d3252e5d66588cd0976d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10513E68_864E_4D8F_8860_24EA263673B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have a tendency to say things I don’t mean the more perturbed I get."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’ai tendance à dire des choses que je ne pense pas quand je suis nerveux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_33015A72_A7C7_49DD_B551_92F3AD4DB0CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1f96afec62d03e49ccd153cf1d2134b93f7d790c2b8f63647be29ce10f31088
#. default-sha256: 9c08348eb4036dcc02ab29cb459e03289189c31fd01c0f8f8359124b65772945
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_33015A72_A7C7_49DD_B551_92F3AD4DB0CF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sure I said things to hurt you numerous times that day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suis sûr que ce jour-là, j’ai dû vous dire des choses blessantes à plusieurs reprises."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A9004BD_F57D_415B_A8B7_1CF5D92D76B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31b8e1bed36a5105ab24707eed4b154f15ee1d1f9d0a2a9e086b9e2c0a5ce5b1
#. default-sha256: 5352017aba40182e7430a8662063c10299135cad5358ef634511f3a7fac3b27b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A9004BD_F57D_415B_A8B7_1CF5D92D76B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫However, at the photography shop, when you saw the phenakistoscope, you smiled for me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pourtant, à l’atelier de photographie, quand vous avez vu le phénakistiscope, vous "
"m’avez souri."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2464D230_600A_4746_8E3B_401DF78C5987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5196c25b5715703df5a44a859cefaaac560f82cb425004d52cf977dadca82c90
#. default-sha256: eedd92d4721d98c42d294734db84b457f3252bcdbd059154e29e885cd16b690b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2464D230_600A_4746_8E3B_401DF78C5987"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫I was genuinely pleased in that moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’étais... ⟪k:1⟫J’étais vraiment content, à ce moment-là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A10FC2F_5A65_43FC_B4D6_EA158DC04EBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e79ebc17039fd49537dca8260469c922e21720012c543ebeda955e911ceeaa5
#. default-sha256: 59de737b087f9993cd4cf322d1471023924dfb75b7ffe7b6defa2d76d2d51ad6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A10FC2F_5A65_43FC_B4D6_EA158DC04EBF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had gotten closer to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’avais l’impression de m’être rapproché de vous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C6151C5_059E_43DA_96D1_C74626D77CBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c67a6d0787f15a6a1441b2ecda212fc23dbac6d0d3de0765726e5c64a3a03300
#. default-sha256: 2094eb941b11cf203e222d95aebfdbb21025363546dee300498172786016bfba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C6151C5_059E_43DA_96D1_C74626D77CBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I very much doubt that was actually an appropriate present for a noblewoman like "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Rétrospectivement, je me dis que ce n’était vraiment pas un cadeau approprié pour une "
"noble comme vous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b5ed1cf39531c46b953e6cea3746c56fb4d7b9649e719d4e9a98f0f175297c2
#. default-sha256: e9749ce6628c78e938d641cb5e32f8b56dc32203dbab18698ce9a20d56e2b03f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jewels or flowers or something like that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫something beautiful—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫would "
"have certainly suited you better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Des bijoux, des fleurs... —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ quelque chose de beau —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ vous auraient "
"certainement plu davantage."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e6e346cb6f3a5079dec8a8ceacb190caf2784f3c10ccda7a520871715b9e75a
#. default-sha256: a85d23be943379e88b9c4b121531fd166e2b4276d8101115337a5a33222c6318
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I knew that, but I assumed you would have been given gifts like that countless times in "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et je le savais, mais je me disais que vous aviez dû en recevoir des dizaines par le passé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37ade51e73c492f978979ee5c122f82faf386fe6fa76c1bb5a2882c865521586
#. default-sha256: 97eaa83bd4e160934aeeb5e33c09fb1e93efdc5d478a718eeebeca77b0d8c474
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You are, after all, a beautiful woman.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did not want to have to compete on the "
"same field as those other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous êtes une belle femme, après tout.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je ne voulais pas lutter sur le même terrain "
"que ces autres hommes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04cff85a52a0ae3d95d2a12ea25444f32403d9917fe5acfeba45f973ed70a189
#. default-sha256: e14104b33769a87f0ba1c2c6201e2773b172c58e4a17a3f1c52bfa5e9073a60b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to be special—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No, I wanted to be ⟪k:4⟫unique⟪k:5⟫ to you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je voulais être spécial—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non, je voulais être ⟪k:4⟫unique⟪k:5⟫ pour vous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1425f011f7f4adfe872ac05523abc892aa3c7f3ec052b748653e4f922cc40b78
#. default-sha256: e53821259d7209d15a692056cf7e2a36ac0d88721a54ef98417b0be9319048d8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had ever shown you anything of the sort before, had they?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Personne ne vous avait montré ce genre de choses auparavant, si ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b68e1ec749d2f3406d5320a6b16041cba2c0f44d321e43783eef9aa0c45eb654
#. default-sha256: effe28e68a7dafc46853a5b940cbd7df389b5f766b5aa424470cee79ab8fba42
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Frankly, I wasn’t sure if a woman of your status would take any interest in a "
"phenakistoscope at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Honnêtement, je n’étais même pas sûr qu’une femme de votre rang s’intéresserait à un "
"phénakistiscope tout court."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52aa1d678b629abb9b01c147a50894e99b3af164a4f29d47e39d2dd6f1d62fbe
#. default-sha256: 55cd8d95c49fb73a0bc5949e6b88c8d13b8c0ec3f4f9820fc6d434a94f83252a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you’ve thrown it out by now,⟪k:1⟫but I choose to believe you sincerely liked it on "
"that day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je pense que vous avez dû vous en débarrasser, depuis le temps,⟪k:1⟫mais j’aime à croire que "
"vous l’avez sincèrement apprécié ce jour-là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ba2a6986527932ffe6e0d8a25701674aac92a6f4e1204b31644f9a4822182cb
#. default-sha256: 83cb806ba80f4141616bc461eb6cb38bd305c781d8449e49707537bd077e650a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That... ⟪k:2⟫if just for a moment... ⟪k:3⟫I caught your eye.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Even if you "
"started seeing other men afterwards,⟪k:6⟫that moment was real, wasn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Que... ⟪k:2⟫ne serait-ce que pour un instant... ⟪k:3⟫j’ai attiré votre attention.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Même si vous avez commencé à voir d’autres hommes après,⟪k:6⟫ce moment, personne ne peut "
"nous l’enlever, n’est-ce pas ?"

